+class Feeder:
+    """S2: owned writer of a frozen RAM proof buffer into ONE checker's stdin pipe; hashes/counts exactly the
+    bytes os.write() accepted.  Modes: plain; suffix (C3: SUFFIX after the proof); hold (C7b: the first write
